    "summary_one_sentence": "Reluctantly pulled back into espionage, Jack Ryan teams up with trusted CIA allies and a sharp MI6 officer to expose a rogue black-ops unit executing a deadly global conspiracy.",
    "summary_short": "When an international covert mission unravels, Jack Ryan is reluctantly drawn back into the dangerous world of high-stakes espionage. Teaming up with seasoned CIA allies Mike November and James Greer, along with sharp MI6 operative Emma Marlowe, he faces a deadly new threat. Together, they must dismantle a rogue black-ops unit operating in the shadows. Racing against time, Jack finds himself in a deeply personal fight where the fate of global security hangs in the balance.",
    "summary_long": "Jack Ryan is reluctantly pulled back into active espionage when a covert international mission goes disastrously wrong. The failed operation uncovers a sinister shadow syndicate embedded within elite military structures, operating a dangerous global conspiracy. To counter the threat, Jack joins forces with his trusted CIA allies James Greer and Mike November. They are joined by Emma Marlowe, a sharp MI6 officer possessing vital intelligence on the rogue faction. As the team tracks the target across international borders, they realize they are up against a highly trained rogue black-ops unit. The conflict grows deeply personal as the rogue group targets those closest to Jack to force his retreat. Navigating high-stakes ambushes, betrayal, and intense political pressure, Jack and his team race against the clock to bring down the network. In a tense final confrontation, Jack must leverage every skill to neutralize the rogue unit and expose the truth to the world.",
